CM_ "BMS ECU CAN database (classic CAN 500 kbit/s, Intel byte order). Single source: bms/common/bms_can.c; every frame ends with a 4-bit alive counter (byte 6, low nibble) and CRC-8 SAE J1850 (poly 0x1D, init/xorout 0xFF) in byte 7 over [ID low byte, ID high byte, data 0..6] (AUTOSAR E2E data-ID idea). Receiver: counter step 1 normal, 2..3 accepted with loss, 0 or >3 rejected; 0x101/0x102 missing 500 ms -> SAFE-STOP.";
CM_ BO_ 257 "Pack measurement, 100 ms. Pack_I positive = discharge.";
CM_ BO_ 258 "Group voltage extremes and ambient temperature, 100 ms.";
CM_ BO_ 513 "ECU control, every BMS step (100 ms): allowed currents, state and cause byte.";
CM_ BO_ 514 "ECU status, every BMS step: SOC, core temperature estimate, SOH, Psi = 1 - I_allow_dis / I_nom.";
CM_ BO_ 528 "Passive balancing command, every BMS step; EMU opens all switches if absent for 250 ms.";
CM_ BO_ 769 "Event message (not periodic, no timeout). Accepted if CRC ok and counter differs from the last accepted command. ECU ignores all commands for 1 s after boot. EMU commands read Cmd_Value as uint16 duration [ms] (0 = until 0x10).";
CM_ SG_ 513 State "1 NORMAL, 2 DERATE, 3 LIMP-HOME, 4 SAFE-STOP.";
CM_ SG_ 513 Cause "Bit field: 1 thermal derate, 2 cooling alarm, 4 SOP discharge, 8 SOP charge, 16 datasheet T limit, 32 sensor fault, 64 SOC empty, 128 hard limit (SAFE). Thermal anomaly and temperature rise rate also set bit 1; resistance growth (1024) and thermal event (2048) exist only in UART telemetry.";
CM_ SG_ 769 Cmd "0x01-0x0F ECU, 0x10-0x1F EMU fault injection.";
CM_ SG_ 769 Cmd_Value "0x01, 0x04 and 0x05 require 0xA5A5 (-23131); 0x02: SOC in 0.01 %.";
CM_ SG_ 528 Cell_dV "V_max - V_min of the 19 groups.";
CM_ BO_ 272 "Group voltages 1..4, 100 ms, 4 x 12 bit, V = 1.000 V + raw x 1 mV, raw 0xFFF = invalid. Byte 6 high nibble = balancing switch feedback per slot. Timeout only disables balancing.";
CM_ BO_ 273 "Group voltages 5..8, 100 ms, 4 x 12 bit, V = 1.000 V + raw x 1 mV, raw 0xFFF = invalid. Byte 6 high nibble = balancing switch feedback per slot. Timeout only disables balancing.";
CM_ BO_ 274 "Group voltages 9..12, 100 ms, 4 x 12 bit, V = 1.000 V + raw x 1 mV, raw 0xFFF = invalid. Byte 6 high nibble = balancing switch feedback per slot. Timeout only disables balancing.";
CM_ BO_ 275 "Group voltages 13..16, 100 ms, 4 x 12 bit, V = 1.000 V + raw x 1 mV, raw 0xFFF = invalid. Byte 6 high nibble = balancing switch feedback per slot. Timeout only disables balancing.";
CM_ BO_ 276 "Group voltages 17..19, 100 ms, 4 x 12 bit, V = 1.000 V + raw x 1 mV, raw 0xFFF = invalid. Byte 6 high nibble = balancing switch feedback per slot. Timeout only disables balancing.";

